    {
      "id": "fr-avenir-3",
      "title": "Je serai ingénieur",
      "subtitle": "The future tense: regular verbs",
      "topics": [
        "futur-simple"
      ],
      "words": [
        "professions#later",
        "professions#one day"
      ],
      "learn": [
        {
          "title": "Futur simple",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The *futur simple* talks about the future, plans and predictions. Take the infinitive and add the endings *-ai, -as, -a, -ons, -ez, -ont*: *travailler → je travaillerai*. For *-re* verbs the final *e* drops: *prendre → je prendrai*."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "travailler",
              "tense": "futur-simple"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "form",
                "verb": "parler",
                "tense": "futur-simple",
                "person": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "futur proche × futur simple",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*Je vais travailler* (futur proche) = soon, the plan is already clear. *Je travaillerai* (futur simple) = later, in general: *Un jour, je travaillerai à Paris.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "title": "endings",
              "en": "The endings look like the present tense of *avoir*: *(j')ai, (tu) as, (il) a, (nous av)ons, (vous av)ez, (ils) ont*."
            },
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Plus tard, je travaillerai dans l'informatique.",
                  "en": "Later I'll work in IT."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Nous habiterons à Paris.",
                  "en": "We'll live in Paris."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Tu prendras le train ?",
                  "en": "Will you take the train?"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Un jour, ils gagneront le championnat.",
                  "en": "One day they'll win the championship."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "Un jour, je ___ à Paris.",
                "a": [
                  "travaillerai"
                ],
                "hint": "travailler"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Words",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "vocab"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
