      "learn": [
        {
          "title": "When?",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "textCols": [0],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "later",
                  "plus tard"
                ],
                [
                  "one day",
                  "un jour"
                ],
                [
                  "in ten years",
                  "dans dix ans"
                ],
                [
                  "next year",
                  "l'année prochaine"
                ],
                [
                  "after the school-leaving exam",
                  "après le bac"
                ],
                [
                  "at university",
                  "à l'université / à la fac"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "title": "dans = in",
              "en": "*Dans* + a length of time = in (in the future): *dans dix ans* (in ten years). *Il y a dix ans* = ten years ago."
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "___ dix ans, je serai ingénieur.",
                "a": [
                  "Dans"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "si + present, then the future",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "A condition that can come true: *si* + present tense, then the future: *Si j'ai mon bac, j'irai à l'université.* Never put the future after *si*, just as in English."
            },
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Si je travaille bien, je réussirai.",
                  "en": "If I work hard, I'll succeed."
